{"sections":{"image_banner":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Inspired_by_Cinderella_1200_x_400_px_11.svg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"center","show_text_below":false}},"image_with_text_4rrWpk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_JfPGDy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Hollywood, California<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_ggcHNL":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Step into the city where Harrison Ford became a legend and explore the heart of the movie industry. From classic film studios to iconic Hollywood landmarks, you can walk in the footsteps of your favourite cinematic heroes. Discover behind-the-scenes experiences, attend studio tours, and explore the history of Hollywood’s golden age, where adventure and storytelling come to life.<\/p><p><br\/><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to start your Hollywood adventure and follow in the footsteps of cinematic legends.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_JfPGDy","text_ggcHNL"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Harrison_Ford_s_Star_on_Hollywood_Blvd.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_wHPt4n":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_kxNwiW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Kauai, Hawaii<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_4PUjgq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Step into the lush, tropical landscapes of Kauai, Hawaii—the dramatic backdrop used in the opening adventure of <em>Raiders of the Lost Ark<\/em>. From towering cliffs and cascading waterfalls to hidden beaches and verdant valleys, Kauai immerses you in a world of adventure and discovery. Trek through dramatic canyons, kayak along winding rivers, or simply take in the panoramic views that make you feel like the hero of your own story.<\/p><p><br\/><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to step into the adventure and write your own cinematic chapter in Kauai.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_kxNwiW","text_4PUjgq"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Napali_0_1_jpg.webp","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_EBCCWn":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_KxPYmx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Disney Parks Around the World<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_Vrhadp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Experience the <strong>Indiana Jones Adventure<\/strong> at Disneyland in California and Tokyo DisneySea, or embark on <strong>Indiana Jones and the Temple of Peril<\/strong> at Disneyland Paris. Each ride immerses you in daring explorations, ancient temples, and cinematic action, allowing you to step straight into a storybook world of courage, discovery, and unforgettable adventure.<\/p><p><br\/><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin your Disney Parks chapter and step into the story that inspired these legendary adventures.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_KxPYmx","text_Vrhadp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/how-many-disney-parks-are-there-hero.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_dYxihL":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_i46LR4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Cairo, Egypt<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_QiUHhp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Embark on a desert adventure inspired by Harrison Ford’s iconic archaeology and treasure-hunting roles. Explore the mystical pyramids, ancient temples, and bustling markets of Cairo, immersing yourself in the rich history and vibrant culture of Egypt. Feel the thrill of discovery as you imagine untold stories hidden within the sands of time.<br\/><br\/><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin crafting your own epic Egyptian story.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_i46LR4","text_QiUHhp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/giza-pyramids-cairo-egypt-with-palm.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["image_banner","image_with_text_4rrWpk","image_with_text_wHPt4n","image_with_text_EBCCWn","image_with_text_dYxihL"]}